## [0.1.0]

### Added:

- Added this CHANGELOG file to track changes to the images.
- Image metadata value "image_builder_version" to track the version of the image builders used when making the image.

### Changed:
- Changed image build flavor to l6.c2 to enable images to be used on VMs with less than 50GB disk.

### Fixed:
- Fix user creation on VMs with 10.10 or 192.168 IP address.
